AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p004","text":"造父幸於周繆王。造父取驥之乘匹，與桃林盜驪、驊騮、緑耳，獻之繆王。繆王使造父御，西巡狩，見西王母，樂之忘歸。而徐偃王反，繆王日馳千里馬，攻徐偃王，大破之。乃賜造父以趙城，由此爲趙氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"造父","kind":"person","person_id":"maz_aq2_t5g_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"周繆王","kind":"person","person_id":"2cx_p6z_4uc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"造父","kind":"person","person_id":"maz_aq2_t5g_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"驥之乘匹","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神祇、馬匹、校勘或未定稱呼保留；不補名字、成員或闕代，故事說詞不作真孤被殺證據。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0019","start":19,"end":27,"surface":"盜驪、驊騮、緑耳","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神祇、馬匹、校勘或未定稱呼保留；不補名字、成員或闕代，故事說詞不作真孤被殺證據。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"繆王","kind":"person","person_id":"2cx_p6z_4uc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"繆王","kind":"person","person_id":"2cx_p6z_4uc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"造父","kind":"person","person_id":"maz_aq2_t5g_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"西王母","kind":"person","person_id":"4t4_ojw_dn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"徐偃王","kind":"person","person_id":"cya_zvr_rpv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"繆王","kind":"person","person_id":"2cx_p6z_4uc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zh